# Fate & Fridge — Docker build context exclusions.
# Keep the image context small and never leak secrets or runtime state.

# Version control / editors
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea

# Secrets and environment files
.env
.env.*

# Runtime data and NAS service-account home (see docs/DEPLOYMENT.md)
data
backups
home

# .NET
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
backend/tests

# Node
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/playwright-report
frontend/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Not needed inside the image
docs
scripts
*.md
